From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tatsuki Tanaka <tatsuki@tanakatatsuki.dev>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 14:16:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8450: add EPSS L3 and CPU OPP tables

Add the epss_l3 interconnect provider node and CPU OPP tables for
the three CPU clusters with peak bandwidth requirements for LLCC,
DDR, and L3 cache, derived from downstream DCVS/memlat tables.

This enables proper CPU to interconnect bandwidth scaling via
qcom-cpufreq-hw, resolving CPU/memory latency bottlenecks during
interactive UI workloads.
